        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-11T05:34:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I thought exactly the same the first time I played this combo.</p>\n<p>However, it is merely a case of wishful thinking on the part of the Heroes.    It  is actually quite clear how this works.</p>\n<p>The “bouncy drug”  clearly reads that it takes effect at the START of the villan turn, so if you wish to return Grease Gun to your hand with it, it is a legal play, however at that point the Grease Gun  is out of play and Spite still has his full turn to deal damage with impunity.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
